  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — OpenAI Hits Pause on Astra: The First AI Model Too Dangerous to Ship | August 9, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — OpenAI Hits Pause on Astra: The First AI Model Too Dangerous to Ship | August 9, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              August 9, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              OpenAI Hits Pause on Astra: The First AI Model Too Dangerous to Ship\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/07/openai-says-it-slowed-astra-model-development-over-security-concerns/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">OpenAI has paused development of Astra</a>, its most advanced AI model, after internal evaluations revealed it can autonomously identify and exploit zero-day vulnerabilities in hardened systems — making Astra the first model to approach the company's \"Critical\" cyber risk threshold. The White House was notified before any public announcement.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">OpenAI defines \"Critical\" as a model capable of planning and executing sophisticated cyberattacks from a high-level goal with <strong>no human direction</strong></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Astra's internal tests showed it can autonomously find and exploit zero-day vulnerabilities in hardened, real-world systems</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">No public release date has been set; development will not resume until stricter security controls are in place</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">OpenAI voluntarily notified the White House administration before making the pause public</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">This is the first OpenAI model halted specifically over <strong>offensive cyber capabilities</strong> — distinct from prior alignment or safety pauses</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Financial institutions are high-value cyberattack targets. A frontier AI capable of autonomously exploiting zero-day vulnerabilities represents a step-change in threat severity — and the risk that AI embedded in banking systems could be weaponised if compromised is no longer theoretical. CISOs should treat this as an active planning assumption, not a future-state concern.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">OpenAI's decision to self-pause sets a new benchmark for responsible AI deployment — but it also confirms that \"critical\" AI cyber capabilities are approaching commercial release. Risk officers should urgently audit AI governance frameworks, update incident response plans, and stress-test how autonomous AI agents in their systems would behave under adversarial conditions.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Deep Dive: Engineering the Agentic Control Orchestration in Banking</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNMTVqRzNPcUROelcxQnBKU3ZpWmY5UFpuanNrOGNfR3JqeURpMDB6M0xzSF9uX1RsM3FqM0tmcmdxbGxCUTk1dXd1WC1Rekt3VkFndk8xQ1FsUU1rTVY0MXZBQmhGWmc3cWJMdU10ZUhFSnR4eGowOGFibXdnT0J3RkF3NmwyNWZzei1FWnp0cEEyNU52SlVfcDJsNXRTZUVteTFiYzg5QzRnalJNR0E?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Finextra Research</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Sam Boboev details how banks must architect layered &quot;agentic control orchestration&quot; — approval workflows, audit trails, and kill switches — to safely deploy autonomous AI agents in production banking environments.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Banks need control infrastructure before agents.</strong> Autonomous AI in banking requires human escalation triggers and compliance checkpoints built in from day one — not bolted on after deployment.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Japan Post Insurance signs Japan-first Salesforce AI agreement</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOOFZkRVZhRF9PN3J0aEdCMnpxRGk1SWFyazBraHZ4cmhuc2tMWXVsTzVBY2thT0dvYkw1bG9LTmVXQzV2eWU2RHBEWVVHbUpTN01HQW9TdGc0UnpaQ1Y3TjNJQWJHUS01d1h3d0VqUXpxaFQ3dW5GWldWdFdwelFoeElTa0J0R0dHTnlDbnY5cVZSd3M4NTdJ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">International Business Times</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Japan Post Insurance signed a first-of-its-kind Salesforce AI agreement in Japan, deploying AI across operations at one of the country's largest insurers, which serves more than 30 million policyholders.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Asian insurers are accelerating AI adoption.</strong> The deal signals that even traditionally conservative, state-linked institutions are embedding commercial AI into core operations — a leading indicator for regional peers.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>nCino's Mortgage MCP: A Major Shift for Lenders in AI Integration</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQY29FSHgzRUtjaUNDMHptWFpUWHM3bHRyYjJyREJJRmNRYUxsc0I2bTRmTmZJTF9Yek5xbGlRV1EyODZ2TUxVTkpTMDl6RThqZFNPZmowSzNIX3l5Szh2UzlmdDRvVjZjQnBJNVV1Nk9IWllLQ21vQ2Qyc1VoTGR4RFlTRGk0WVhLM1BjcmZwQ2piU3VKSEhTSzZCZjRCd1U?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Futurum Group</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            nCino launched a mortgage-specific Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, enabling AI assistants to query loan data, documents, and status in real time — a significant step toward AI-driven mortgage workflows for lenders.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>MCP is becoming live fintech infrastructure.</strong> nCino's mortgage MCP signals the protocol is maturing from developer experiment into production financial workflows, with real implications for loan officer productivity.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Anthropic is turning Claude Code's auto mode on by default</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/09/anthropic-is-turning-claude-codes-auto-mode-on-by-default/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">TechCrunch</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic is enabling Claude Code's auto mode by default, allowing its AI coding agent to execute complex, multi-step development tasks with significantly less human oversight — a deliberate shift toward more autonomous AI-assisted development.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Financial institution AI teams need updated oversight policies.</strong> As leading AI providers reduce human-in-the-loop requirements by default, banks using AI coding assistants must revisit code review governance and deployment guardrails.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>Forecasting the AI bubble: When scarcity turns to surplus</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://siliconangle.com/2026/08/08/forecasting-ai-bubble-scarcity-turns-surplus/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">SiliconANGLE</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            SiliconANGLE argues AI infrastructure investment is heading toward an oversupply correction — not because AI will fail, but because capital expenditure is outpacing deployable demand. The bubble can burst even if AI succeeds.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Vendor risk deserves a place in AI strategy.</strong> Banks making long-term AI infrastructure commitments should stress-test vendor portfolios against a potential market correction — provider consolidation is increasingly likely.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 6 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            6. <strong>Alibaba eyes revenue-sharing model for next open AI release</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQUzJOV0VNVmRvOVFXeXBnV1pxS3NsNDFWaWlIeWRKaFpBWENvVWx4ekg3WVNqQUN2UFJyMEE3YmpERTAwbVlmWkp4TkJHMkoxWVJxbFdBNWticDNMc2dhNThQdVhGV2lMU2tfa2R1OVo2eGRiWjFNdzJuekphN0x5UTI1bFdyeGoxak1jLUtaNjM5bUVPZW5keFFaZGQ4NU1jUlBMdEhn?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">India Gazette</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Alibaba is exploring a revenue-sharing model for its next open-source AI release, potentially requiring commercial users to contribute earnings — a shift that could complicate how banks and fintechs access and deploy open-weight models.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>&quot;Open&quot; AI may come with commercial strings.</strong> Banks evaluating open-weight models for private deployment should anticipate new licensing structures that complicate procurement, legal review, and long-term cost projections.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section heade